    {
      "id": "kwf8D1qtmCx5327XntJGJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -570.3588108912164,
      "y": -147.95510216906104,
      "width": 762.7394409179688,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1754447314,
      "version": 1243,
      "versionNonce": 1406561298,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771779814418,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Functional Requirements\n\n-Users should be able to set, get, and delete key-value pairs.\n-Users should be able to configure the expiration time for key-value pairs. \n-Data should be evicted according to Least Recently Used (LRU) policy.\n\n2. Non - Functional Requirent\n\n- High Avilability >> Consistency (Eventual)\n\nIn a In distributed cache, we typically favor High Availability over Consistency\nbecause caches aren’t the source of truth.\nStale data is tolerable in exchange for low latency and resilience.”\n\n- Latency per request should be ~ <10ms\n\n- should support storage upto 1TB data and 100K request per second\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Functional Requirements\n\n-Users should be able to set, get, and delete key-value pairs.\n-Users should be able to configure the expiration time for key-value pairs. \n-Data should be evicted according to Least Recently Used (LRU) policy.\n\n2. Non - Functional Requirent\n\n- High Avilability >> Consistency (Eventual)\n\nIn a In distributed cache, we typically favor High Availability over Consistency\nbecause caches aren’t the source of truth.\nStale data is tolerable in exchange for low latency and resilience.”\n\n- Latency per request should be ~ <10ms\n\n- should support storage upto 1TB data and 100K request per second\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MRj0xohQvEI5lqGW7lQFr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -512.5747507758558,
      "y": 360.73026471089054,
      "width": 301.1697411493212,
      "height": 318.259729270628,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 298796046,
      "version": 944,
      "versionNonce": 1871325006,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771781844601,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Core Entities\n    \n CachEntry\n      -  Key : String\n      - Value\n      - TTL \n      - Last Used\n\n CacheNode\n     - node_id\n     - status\n     - shard_range\n\n ReplicationNode\n     - primary_node\n     - replicas[]\n     - sync_status",
      "fontSize": 14.97692843626485,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Core Entities\n    \n CachEntry\n      -  Key : String\n      - Value\n      - TTL \n      - Last Used\n\n CacheNode\n     - node_id\n     - status\n     - shard_range\n\n ReplicationNode\n     - primary_node\n     - replicas[]\n     - sync_status",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
